{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/Library_logo.png?t=1750152455\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a mysterious world where mythology and mythic wrestling collide. In this mystical roguelike, you play as Maj, a wandering soul driven by redemption and purpose. Master grapples, throws, and counters in battles where every encounter with twisted spirits and mythic heroes feels like an ancient duel of strength, wit, and resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Free Flowing Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in close-quarters, wrestling-inspired melee combat with tactical options and counters that demand timing and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/ROFSteam_Gif700x200_02.gif?t=1750152455\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">D<strong>ynamic Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the ever-shifting labyrinth of storms and enchanted valleys. Each descent into the cursed Byzantine citadel presents winding paths, dangerous encounters, and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/Realm_of_Fame_Dynamic_Dungeons.gif?t=1750152455\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Legendary Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle  iconic bosses and mythic characters like Hercules, who wield both physical prowess and powerful abilities that will challenge your skills and adaptability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/BossHigh1750x500Gif15f.gif?t=1750152455\" /></div><strong>Fragments of Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover cryptic lore, environmental storytelling, and rare encounters that offer glimpses into the enigmatic forces that shape the Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/ROFSteam_TalktoAnahita_Gif700x200.gif?t=1750152455\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Hero</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maj is a wrestler gifted with supernatural strength by a mystical force called the Lover\u2019s Wind. However, his actions accidentally release its counterpart, the Evil Wind, a destructive power that spreads chaos across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/extras/Steam-Maj_back-and-Front-2.png?t=1750152455\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3310030?t=1750152455","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/a30b87d33a745cc3d95ee1de07fea44ab40d5ac6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750152455","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/611d93cf9b1102865e811351bb7379173a6f9789/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750152455","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310030/611d93cf9b1102865e811351bb7379173a6f9789/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750152455","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragrap